{"items":[{"id":"1739580308729712640","title":"今早陪着家人来上香，没啥事闲逛听到主持…","content":"<p>今早陪着家人来上香，没啥事闲逛听到主持说了一句话。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;今年香火钱都少了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;没忍住，笑了。</p>","excerpt":"今早陪着家人来上香，没啥事闲逛听到主持…","voteupCount":159,"commentCount":18,"created":1707528383,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1739580308729712640"},{"id":"1737821043195199488","title":"生孩子还有这个用处? 〒_〒","content":"<p>生孩子还有这个用处?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;〒_〒</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-ecdf857487ad68833d4dbb5778a9b9fe_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"501\">","excerpt":"生孩子还有这个用处? 〒_〒","voteupCount":102,"commentCount":17,"created":1707108823,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1737821043195199488"},{"id":"1736819271643201536","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9bb6d3b852bf1636f4e9afde1c1fd608_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"928\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":150,"commentCount":17,"created":1706869982,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1736819271643201536"},{"id":"1736040008551591936","title":"新年新气象，2024年元旦后，中国股市表现…","content":"<p>新年新气象，2024年元旦后，中国股市表现：&lt;br&gt;1月2日下跌2307家&lt;br&gt;1月3日下跌3158家&lt;br&gt;1月4日下跌3236家&lt;br&gt;1月5日下跌4759家&lt;br&gt;1月8日下跌4896家&lt;br&gt;1月9日下跌1679家&lt;br&gt;1月10日下跌3818家&lt;br&gt;1月11日下跌760家&lt;br&gt;1月12日下跌3753家&lt;br&gt;1月15日下跌3116家&lt;br&gt;1月16日下跌3520家&lt;br&gt;1月17日下跌5031家&lt;br&gt;1月18日下跌3539家&lt;br&gt;1月19日下跌4176家&lt;br&gt;1月22日下跌5184家&lt;br&gt;1月23日下跌2199家&lt;br&gt;1月24日下跌1237家&lt;br&gt;1月25日下跌427家&lt;br&gt;1月26日下跌3032家&lt;br&gt;1月29日下跌4822家&lt;br&gt;1月30日下跌5015家</p>","excerpt":"新年新气象，2024年元旦后，中国股市表现…","voteupCount":127,"commentCount":31,"created":1706684192,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1736040008551591936"},{"id":"1734510519766224896","title":"早上被我妈拉去放生","content":"<p>早上被我妈拉去放生。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;没办法，老人家爱这一口，只能大清早跟着去了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我妈下车，我很狗腿跑过去：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;妈，我替你着拿着鱼。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我妈瞥了我一眼，很不满意：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;这不是鱼，这是功德。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：好好好，是功德，是功德。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;然后我妈就开始提，提了几分钟感觉不对劲，就忽悠我：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;来吧，你提着。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：(๑• . •๑)?，这不是功德嘛，为啥让我提。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我妈：我心善，看不得你走歧途，给你分点功德。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我能说啥？只能老老实实把功德拿着。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;然后放完生，我要去洗手，我妈不是很高兴：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;你洗那么快干嘛，让功德多留你手里一会儿行不行。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我：……是是是 你说的都对</p>","excerpt":"早上被我妈拉去放生","voteupCount":76,"commentCount":16,"created":1706320016,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1734510519766224896"},{"id":"1733677960098525184","title":"死了都要追求编制","content":"<p>死了都要追求编制。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;这不魔怔，这很中国。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-576fe2a2e3e7e4ce54af3639d5948851_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"2532\">","excerpt":"死了都要追求编制","voteupCount":165,"commentCount":9,"created":1706121035,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1733677960098525184"},{"id":"1732940944691924993","title":"政策发力了","content":"<p>政策发力了</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-687223827d1443e002f74825de7bb064_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1057\" height=\"195\">","excerpt":"政策发力了","voteupCount":149,"commentCount":18,"created":1705945317,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1732940944691924993"},{"id":"1732732077802524672","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-6dece023341c25ce3be2d38667fe7538_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"690\" height=\"582\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":140,"commentCount":3,"created":1705895520,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1732732077802524672"},{"id":"1727450573580959745","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8ca3bf928086ea7f4aefc68a7319f459_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"731\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":158,"commentCount":6,"created":1704636311,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1727450573580959745"},{"id":"1726740397395791873","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-b0b78a96f7c3821c8466d8609fcc35a8_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"426\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":151,"commentCount":8,"created":1704466992,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1726740397395791873"}]}